        <figure><a href="evidence/sprint-planning.jpg" target="_blank"><img src="evidence/sprint-planning.jpg" alt="Sprint planning discussion" /></a><figcaption><strong>Sprint planning</strong><p>Shows Sprint planning discussion and dependency/ownership coordination. Current issue ownership is documented in the 23 August handbook.</p><span>Initial plan · Methodology</span></figcaption></figure>
